items/lem-dependent-choice-along-a-sequence-of-relations.md:4:title: "Dependent choice along a sequence of relations: if $R_n$ is entire on $A$ for every $n$, then from any $a$ there is a sequence with $a_n \\mathbin{R_n} a_{n+1}$"
items/lem-dependent-choice-along-a-sequence-of-relations.md:10:deps: [def-dependent-choice, def-sequence-convergence-top, def-natural-numbers, thm-induction-principle]
